    <string name="about_model_body">On-device gradient-boosted classifier trained on the project\'s 300-row internal dataset. Metrics are internal only.</string>
    <string name="about_swbra_heading">SWBRA</string>
    <string name="about_swbra_body">SWBRA (Saliva Weighted Biomarker Risk Algorithm) is documented in the project README, but the source does not provide validated thresholds, units, or missing-value handling and the app does not collect its required biomarkers. To avoid invented scores, SWBRA is shown as unavailable.</string>
    <string name="about_license_heading">License</string>
    <string name="about_license_body">Academic and research use only. Not an OSI-approved open-source license; legal review is required before any other use.</string>
    <string name="about_disclaimer_heading">Medical disclaimer</string>
    <string name="about_disclaimer_body">SURAS is a research prototype and decision-support aid. It is not a medical device and does not provide a diagnosis. Do not use it as the sole basis for clinical decisions.</string>
    <string name="about_data_heading">Data handling</string>
    <string name="about_data_body">Assessments are stored only on this device in a SQLCipher-encrypted database. The app has no analytics. Background update checks contact GitHub Releases and send no patient data.</string>
